<title>BELGIUM: EU to set GATT wheat quota import standards.</title>
<headline>EU to set GATT wheat quota import standards.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-09-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union cereals experts will discuss on Thursday the quality standards to apply to wheat imported under the GATT minimum access agreement, an EU official said.</p>
<p>&quot;The experts group will also set dates for inviting tenders for the import of 200,000 tonnes of soft wheat and 100,000 tonnes of durum wheat required under the General Agreement on Tariffs and Trade,&quot; the official said.</p>
<p>If a decision is reached by the experts group it may go to a vote in the cereals management committee meeting afterwards.</p>
</text>
